    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the darkness with Prometheus</strong>, a brave soul exploring a hostile world in search of the lost light. In this demo, you will experience a fragment of the full game, facing challenges in exploration, combat, and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s included in this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e <strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Shoot enemies to recover oxygen and collect &quot;echoes.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/ea9112a25eb75716563a78caa395087f.poster.avif?t=1749984987\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/ea9112a25eb75716563a78caa395087f.webm?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/ea9112a25eb75716563a78caa395087f.mp4?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Exploration and Survival:</strong> Is it too dark to see ahead? Use the light from your arrows to illuminate the path and avoid hidden dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/7d778fabfb494308e6ec65e1fa9656ec.poster.avif?t=1749984987\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/7d778fabfb494308e6ec65e1fa9656ec.webm?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/7d778fabfb494308e6ec65e1fa9656ec.mp4?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 <strong>Constellation Puzzles:</strong> Find and collect 3 stars to activate a zodiac stone and solve its enigma. Your &quot;helmet&quot; indicates oxygen loss over time, so don\u2019t delay\u2014find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/34d710acc4f20856dc0d03009577f323.poster.avif?t=1749984987\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/34d710acc4f20856dc0d03009577f323.webm?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/34d710acc4f20856dc0d03009577f323.mp4?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Dash Ability:</strong> Propel yourself in any direction to dodge obstacles or reach new areas. Be careful not to fall into pits, or you'll have to start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/034dca86cb8b9331843f749b2f1d375c.poster.avif?t=1749984987\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/034dca86cb8b9331843f749b2f1d375c.webm?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576720/extras/034dca86cb8b9331843f749b2f1d375c.mp4?t=1749984987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
